@RUN   ALBANY,76104,CS301,1,20
@APL,I
$CM SORTING: NUMBERS UP AND DOWN, THEN NAMES INTO ALPHABETICAL ORDER
V $AL 31 4 15 92 65 35 89 79
V$LB$GU V$RB
V$LB$GD V$RB
$CM THE NAMES, A ROW EACH, BLANKS AFTER
W $AL 5 6$RH'SMITH JONES ADAMS BAKER ADAIR '
W
$CM EACH LETTER'S PLACE IN THE ALPHABET, AND A ROW READ AS ONE NUMBER
A $AL ' ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ'
K $AL 27$DC$TR A$IO W
W$LB$GU K;$RB
@FIN
